      "voiceId": "chris-williamson",
      "voiceName": "Chris Williamson",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The nuance of friends and enemies.\n\n\u201cThe friend of your friend is likely to be your friend.\n\nThe enemy of your friend is likely your enemy.\n\nThe friend of your enemy is likely your enemy.\n\nBut the enemy of your enemy is unlikely to be your friend.\n\nIn fact, that person is more likely to be an enemy.\u201d \u2014 Nicholas Christakis via @robkhenderson",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ChrisWillx/status/2043061499120214240",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-11T20:19:54+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "chris-williamson",
      "voiceName": "Chris Williamson",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "If You Couldn't Fail, What Would You Do?\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ChrisWillx/status/2043014810023915998",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-11T17:14:22+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "chris-williamson",
      "voiceName": "Chris Williamson",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Marry the person you can go to war with.\n\n\u201cDon\u2019t marry the person you can have fun with.\n\nMarry the person you can suffer with.\n\nAnyone can love you when life is good.\n\nWhen everything\u2019s easy.\n\nWhen the money\u2019s flowing and the smiles come naturally.\n\nThat part is simple.\n\nThat\u2019s not the test.\n\nLove isn\u2019t proven on the best days.\n\nIt\u2019s revealed on the worst ones.\n\nWhen life hits hard.\n\nWhen everything feels uncertain.\n\nWhen the future looks terrifying and you don\u2019t know what comes next.\n\nThat\u2019s w",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ChrisWillx/status/2042676215107195284",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-10T18:48:55+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "chris-williamson",
      "voiceName": "Chris Williamson",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The Self Help Trap\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ChrisWillx/status/2042611057840263299",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-10T14:30:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
