    {
      "voiceId": "chris-williamson",
      "voiceName": "Chris Williamson",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "What a way to finish.\n\nNelson Rockefeller, former Vice President of the United States and heir to the Rockefeller family fortune, died in 1979 of a heart attack at age 70, rumored to be caused by an orgasm during intercourse with his secretary, Megan Marshack.\n\nThe unusual circumstances surrounding his death caused New York magazine to quip, \u201cNelson thought he was coming, but he was going\u201d.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ChrisWillx/status/2041612727828017389",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-07T20:23:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
